openai_raw_latex:
\begin{proposition}\label{subcontract}
Let $G$ be a mixed graph and $S$ be a strongly connected directed subgraph of $G$. Then $\chi_G(k)=\chi_{G/S}(k)$. 
\end{proposition}

\begin{proof}
Let $s$ be the vertex that $S$ contracts to in $G/S$. For each weak proper $k$-coloring of $G$, the vertices of $S$ must all be colored the same color $j$. By defining $c(s) = j$ we get a bijection between the weak proper $k$-colorings of $G$ and $G/S$.
\end{proof}

